    <!-- Diálogo de ayuda -->
    <string name="unidad_info_titulo">About the Unit Converter</string>
    <string name="conversor_info_1">• Type a value and you will see it in every unit of the category as you type.</string>
    <string name="conversor_info_2">• Feet and inches: 5\'11, 5\'11.5\" or 5 ft 11 in. Pounds and ounces: 7 lb 4 oz. The keys next to the field add \' \" lb and oz.</string>
    <string name="conversor_info_3">• If you type or paste the unit (180 cm, 70 kg, 30 °C), it is detected and the category changes by itself.</string>
    <string name="conversor_info_4">• Tap a result to use it as the new value. The copy icon copies it.</string>
